{"type":"message","id":"d8c2f227","parentId":"ef3a03b9","timestamp":"2026-04-08T19:03:40.022Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:49f9b6b8-cb9d-4765-89bf-039c22e5b1ca 每小时群知识积累] 请执行群知识学习任务：\n1. 搜索飞书群，找出24小时内有更新的酒店相关群（关键词：酒店、经营、市场、收益、虫洞）\n2. 获取最新消息（每群最多20条）\n3. 分析消息风格、关键字、行动项\n4. 更新 memory/group-learning-tracker.md 记录已学习群\n5. 如果学到新内容，更新到 memory/2026-04-07.md\n\n注意：只学习新消息，不要重复学习已记录的群\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 9th, 2026 - 3:03 AM (Asia/Shanghai) / 2026-04-08 19:03 UTC\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775675019971}}
