{"type":"message","id":"75367f21","parentId":"63aaf14d","timestamp":"2026-04-08T19:04:37.158Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All Feishu API tools are returning \"need_user_authorization\" at 3 AM. This is a known pattern from the tracker. The issue is that the OAuth token for the user has expired or is invalid during this time period.\n\nLet me check if there's a way to re-authenticate or if I should just document this in the tracker and daily notes. Based on the tracker, this is a consistent late-night API issue. \n\nThe current time is 3:03 AM, and the tracker confirms that from 22:00 onwards the API consistently returns this error. The last successful API calls were at 21:02 and before. Let me document this in the tracker and daily notes.\n\n\nNow I'll update the tracker file with the 3:03 AM findings and check the daily notes to add this information.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"All Feishu APIs consistently return `need_user_authorization` at 3 AM — this is a known pattern documented in the tracker. Let me update the memory files and complete this check.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kvuuqpe61vox_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> memory/group-learning-tracker.md << 'EOF'\n\n## 03:03 检查结果 (2026-04-09)\n- **检查时间**: 2026-04-09 03:03 (Asia/Shanghai)\n- **搜索关键词**: 酒店、经营、市场、收益、虫洞\n- **24小时内有实质新消息的群**: ❌ 无法确认\n- **状态**: ❌ 飞书API权限受限（need_user_authorization），所有搜索均失败\n- **规律确认**: 22:02→23:02→00:02→01:02→02:02→03:03 连续6个时段API不可用，超出\"晚间静默\"解释范围，**疑似OAuth Token夜间自动失效机制**\n\n### API权限问题分析\n- feishu_chat → need_user_authorization\n- feishu_im_user_get_messages → need_user_authorization  \n- feishu_im_user_search_messages → need_user_authorization\n- feishu_get_user → need_user_authorization\n- 所有飞书API工具均返回相同错误\n- **核心问题**: OAuth Token 在夜间22:00后自动失效或被飞书安全策略限制\n- **规律确认**: 连续6小时以上不可用（非偶发网络问题）\n\n### 本次扫描已验证的群（历史记录，未重复读取）\n| 群ID | 群名称 | 最后活跃 | 状态 |\n|------|--------|----------|------|\n| oc_fe89d2c0436adf59c54747a10131a045 | TJ-酒店客房预订群 | 21:21 杨正亚新单 | ✅ 已学（22:02） |\n| oc_24e2941fcd1de842d9a4b482bf59ef62 | TJ-边防预订群 | 21:21 中交一航局订单 | ✅ 已学（22:02） |\n| 所有其他已知群 | 晚间静默 | 21:00前 | ✅ 已学 |\n\n### 夜间API规律总结（4/8-4/9）\n- **22:00-03:03**: 连续6小时飞书OAuth Token不可用\n- **可能原因**: 飞书安全策略在非工作时段（22:00-07:00）自动吊销Token\n- **解决方案**: 仅在07:00-21:00时段安排群知识学习cron任务\n- **已验证工作时段**: 06:02（✅成功）、07:02（✅成功）、09:04（✅成功）、11:02-17:02（✅成功多次）、21:02-22:02（✅成功）\n- **失败时段**: 22:00-03:03（连续6小时失败）\n\n### 下次建议\n- 将cron任务调整为 **07:00、09:00、11:00、13:00、15:00、17:00、19:00、21:00** 共8次\n- 移除22:00及之后的夜间检查（API不可用）\n- 如需凌晨检查飞书消息，需重新设计OAuth Token刷新机制\n\nEOF\necho \"Tracker updated successfully\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":225,"output":895,"cacheRead":59579,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":60699,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775675057676,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d72a4ea2-2907-4170-bde3-ef61c9d0d136"}}
