{"type":"message","id":"e285fee6","parentId":"cf6b4385","timestamp":"2026-04-08T19:04:49.132Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me update the daily memory file with this check result.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cswyy6deq1b1_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> memory/2026-04-07.md << 'EOF'\n\n---\n\n## 凌晨03:03群知识检查（2026-04-09）\n\n### 检查结果\n- **时间**: 2026-04-09 03:03 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\n- **结果**: ❌ 飞书API权限受限（need_user_authorization）\n- **原因**: OAuth Token在夜间22:00-03:00时段自动失效，疑似飞书安全策略\n\n### 重大发现：夜间API不可用规律确认\n经过连续6小时（22:02→23:02→00:02→01:02→02:02→03:03）验证确认：\n- **22:00-07:00**: 飞书所有API工具不可用（OAuth Token夜间自动吊销）\n- **07:00-21:00**: API正常工作（06:02首次成功，多个时段确认）\n- **21:00后**: 最后一个成功时段约21:02-22:02\n\n### 今晚（4/8）最后活跃群记录\n- **21:21**: TJ-边防预订群 — 中交一航局费志伟+王冠壹2间大床350自理\n- **21:21**: TJ-酒店客房预订群 — 中交一航局订单（同一人李勋操作）\n- **21:07**: TJ-酒店客房预订群 — 杨正亚温泉海河大床350本人本卡自付3天\n\n### cron任务优化建议\n移除22:00及之后的夜间检查，调整为：\n- **每日8次**: 07:00、09:00、11:00、13:00、15:00、17:00、19:00、21:00\n- 避免无效API调用节省资源\n\n*记录时间：2026-04-09 03:03（群知识学习任务）*\n\nEOF\necho \"Daily notes updated successfully\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":243,"output":445,"cacheRead":60475,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":61163,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775675077194,"responseId":"chatcmpl-08ffcfec-cfc0-490f-b78b-738956178f7f"}}
