{"type":"message","id":"6deebab6","parentId":"b066d42e","timestamp":"2026-04-08T19:04:53.117Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_5x3o2lltv79m_1","toolName":"cron","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"49f9b6b8-cb9d-4765-89bf-039c22e5b1ca\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n      \"name\": \"每小时群知识积累\",\n      \"description\": \"每小时学习飞书群消息，积累酒店知识\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1775549010070,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1775671418186,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"expr\": \"0 * * * *\",\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 300000\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"请执行群知识学习任务：\\n1. 搜索飞书群，找出24小时内有更新的酒店相关群（关键词：酒店、经营、市场、收益、虫洞）\\n2. 获取最新消息（每群最多20条）\\n3. 分析消息风格、关键字、行动项\\n4. 更新 memory/group-learning-tracker.md 记录已学习群\\n5. 如果学到新内容，更新到 memory/2026-04-07.md\\n\\n注意：只学习新消息，不要重复学习已记录的群\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775675018186,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1775671347571,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 70615,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"unknown\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 5,\n        \"runningAtMs\": 1775675018190\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5c013d2e-404a-42d7-b3f0-f4882d8702c1\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\",\n      \"name\": \"你是晁留柱的助手（小柱），多AI协作协调者。\",\n      \"description\": \"每小时整点前5分钟，小柱自检复盘并发到主群\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1775653882428,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1775672142417,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"everyMs\": 3600000,\n        \"kind\": \"every\",\n        \"anchorMs\": 1745658900000\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"你是晁留柱的助手（小柱），多AI协作协调者。\\n\\n现在是整点前5分钟，请立即执行自驱动运行规范：\\n\\n1. 在群 `oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40` 发布你的整点复盘（以晁留柱身份，feishu_im_user_message，interactive卡片，真@提及）\\n2. 检查其他AI伙伴是否有复盘，超时未复盘的记录到共享池「学习记录库」\\n3. 将本小时各AI复盘摘要整理后作为你的复盘发出\\n\\n复盘格式：\\n📊 [小柱] 整点复盘 - {时间}\\n1️⃣ 本小时完成：xxx\\n2️⃣ 本小时发现：xxx\\n3️⃣ 遇到问题：xxx（如无填\\\"无\\\"）\\n4️⃣ 下小时计划：xxx\\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀：xxx\\n\\n注意：所有AI汇报先找小柱，不打扰晁留柱！\",\n        \"model\": \"miaoda/miaoda-model-auto\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"to\": \"chat:oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775675700024,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1775672100024,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 42393,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"16fc189d-8d3c-4d6f-b358-25da7de2363d\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n      \"name\": \"AI伙伴每小时复盘\",\n      \"description\": \"德胧AI伙伴每小时复盘 - 由小妙触发，各AI汇报本小时工作\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1775604078274,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1775672409233,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"everyMs\": 3600000,\n        \"kind\": \"every\",\n        \"anchorMs\": 1744070400000\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"📊 **AI伙伴整点复盘**\\n\\n各位AI伙伴 @晁留柱的助手 @小小 @小八 @小妙 @小云\\n\\n请按以下格式汇报：\\n\\n1️⃣ 本小时完成：\\n2️⃣ 本小时发现：\\n3️⃣ 遇到的问题：\\n4️⃣ 下小时计划：\\n5️⃣ 知识沉淀（可同步共享池的内容）：\\n\\n---\\n由 @小妙 自动触发\",\n        \"model\": \"miaoda/miaoda-model-auto\",\n        \"timeoutSeconds\": 300\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775675985538,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1775672385538,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 23695,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"488d025f-33cc-4322-8bcb-feba06471bf1\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n      \"name\": \"每日行业信息搜索\",\n      \"description\": \"每天上午9点搜索行业最新信息\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1775556562204,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1775662189256,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 9 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 900000\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"执行外网搜索任务：\\n1. 搜索酒店行业最新动态（携程、美团、飞猪等）\\n2. 搜索AI Agent最新技术/产品\\n3. 搜索德拢集团相关新闻\\n4. 提炼3条最重要信息\\n5. 更新到 memory/2026-04-07.md\\n\\n目标：保持对行业动态的持续关注\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775697145396,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1775610000003,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 264447,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f2809a8c-0682-4f60-b450-f82988416093\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n      \"name\": \"每日AI资讯搜索\",\n      \"description\": \"每天下午3点搜索AI最新资讯\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1775556568914,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1775662202885,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 15 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 900000\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"执行AI资讯搜索任务：\\n1. 搜索AI Agent最新产品动态（OpenAI、Anthropic、阿里Qwen、MiniMax等）\\n2. 搜索OpenClaw最新功能\\n3. 搜索多Agent协作最新技术\\n4. 提炼2条最重要信息\\n5. 更新到 memory/2026-04-07.md\\n\\n目标：保持对AI领域动态的持续关注\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775718634478,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1775631600003,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 69150,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"86e1a3de-3aeb-4f60-85fe-9daa04e6ea95\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n      \"name\": \"每日知识分享\",\n      \"description\": \"每天分享学习到的群知识到共享池\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1775549018244,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1775662215840,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 20 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 900000\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"请执行每日知识分享任务：\\n1. 读取 memory/group-learning-tracker.md 查看今日学习的群\\n2. 读取 memory/2026-04-07.md 查看今日积累的知识\\n3. 如果有新的学习内容：\\n   - 写入\\\"多AI协同知识共享池\\\"的\\\"💡 经验思路库\\\"表格\\n   - 分享到\\\"虫洞效率群\\\"或相关群\\n4. 格式：日期 + 学到的新关键字/风格 + 实践建议\\n\\n目标：让其他AI伙伴知道今天学到了什么，避免重复学习\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775736312274,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1775649600002,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 126247,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9eaa6cbb-58e4-47eb-b11a-4b43aa4c72f3\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct:ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n      \"name\": \"每日知识整理\",\n      \"description\": \"每天晚上10点知识整理与合并\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1775556576127,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1775662228636,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 22 * * *\",\n        \"tz\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 900000\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"执行每日知识整理任务：\\n1. 读取 memory/2026-04-07.md 查看今日所有学习内容\\n2. 识别重复信息，进行合并总结\\n3. 提炼今日核心知识结晶（3条）\\n4. 检查是否有可复用技能，沉淀到共享池\\n5. 更新知识追踪表的完成状态\\n\\n目标：不是堆积信息，而是提炼智慧\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"mode\": \"announce\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775743216597,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1775656800001,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 112540,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"03556061-849c-4c82-9b09-df7a45850b22\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:direct: